13251.jpg"}], "slug": "neoneon-tribe", "storyline": "Set in the chaotic and neon-drenched Neo Tokyo, NEONEON TRIBE serves as a bold, experimental reimagining of the Tribe Nine universe. This version strips away the traditional constraints to focus on a \"pirate broadcast\" narrative style, where the line between reality and digital distortion is constantly blurred.\n\nThe story follows the members of the Minato Tribe as they navigate a world governed by Extreme Baseball and psychological warfare. Unlike previous iterations, this narrative dives deeper into the deconstruction of its characters, utilizing \"meta\" storytelling techniques and a glitch-heavy aesthetic to reflect a society on the brink of collapse.", "summary": "A \"VN/WEB\" of the original tribe nine, it is a version created by the original group with the aim of adapting/finishing the story of the gacha game.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/neoneon-tribe"}